      MaskType      "RateLimiter (motulator)"
      MaskDescription "Rate limiter (RateLimiter): the rising and falling rates of the signal are limited to rate_limit, e.g., the slew rate of the speed reference (mechanical rad/s²) in VHzControlSystem."
      MaskIconFrame on
